# Adapted from Polestar's guide forever/alliance/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills (GPL-3.0, github.com/fitzforge/polestar, tag v0.3.4).
# Changes: guide id, title, folder, next guide, group notes. Quest steps kept as Polestar wrote them,
# except where a comment marked "Groupe Alliance" says otherwise.
guide groupe-alliance/14-paluns-hautebrande
title Group 12 · Wetlands & Hillsbrad Foothills
folder Group Alliance
faction Alliance
levels 31-32
zone Wetlands
next groupe-alliance/15-desolace

# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: Defeat Nek'rosh (474), MacKreel's Moonshine (647), Sully Balloo's Letter (637), Ironband Wants You! (707), Sara Balloo's Plea (683).

step To Deepwater Tavern
  zone Wetlands
  note Everyone at their own pace: what you already did ticks itself, the guide picks up where you are. Playing together? Group XP is best within 4 levels.
  goto 10.7,61.0 "Deepwater Tavern"

step Menethil Harbor
  accept 98230                        -- Captain Stoutfist: for Howin Kindfeather; on the top floor

# Groupe Alliance (0.9.9): Crimson Crate Delivery (98240) follows Crocs of the Sky (98072, handed in
# below), so only whoever got it early hands it in here. Razormaw Needling (98245) is offered
# without it on Forever (Wowhead Forever comments), so it stays a plain accept.
step Howin Kindfeather
  turnin 98240
  turnin 98230                        -- Howin Kindfeather
  accept 98245
  accept 98300 optional               -- For King Magni in Ironforge, at the end of this guide

step Angerfang Encampment
  tip South to the Dragonmaw's Angerfang Encampment: the first catapult stands on the way, and the Tattered Spellbook lies in the camp.
  turnin 465                          -- Dragonmaw Catapult

step Angerfang Encampment
  when group 474
  accept 474

step Angerfang Encampment
  note The next step, Defeat Nek'rosh, pits you against an elite chieftain: skip it.
  accept 98223 object 671518          -- Tattered Spellbook: for Captain Stoutfist

step Defeat Nek'rosh
  when group 474
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Chieftain Nek'rosh is a level 32 elite: most classes solo it at level 34, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.
  tip Careful: Shadowcasters stand on either side of him, and at least one is linked to him, so it joins when he is pulled. Non-elite centurions and captains are spread around his ring of tents.
  collect 3625 quest 474.1 @53.5,54.7 map 1437

step Golm
  tip Golm stands in the south-eastern hills: use the Goaz Stone beside it.
  collect 280397 quest 98310.3        -- Heart of Golm

step Dragonmaw Gates: kill these as you meet them
  zone Wetlands
  tip North-east to the Dragonmaw Gates: Ados stands at the gates (use the Goaz Stone).
  collect 280395 quest 98310.1        -- Heart of Ados
  collect 280103 quest 98245.1        -- Razormaw Incisor
  collect 280331 quest 98283.1 optional   -- Malignant Rotclaw Flesh, from the Maddened Rotclaws: leave it in Carnage's cave (69.5,34.7) to call it
  collect 280330 quest 98283.2 optional -- Carnage's Head
  collect 279385 quest 98072.1        -- Pristine Crimson Scale
  collect 280398 quest 98310.4        -- Heart of Neru

step The Green Belt
  when onquest 98283
  turnin 98283 optional               -- Rethiel the Greenwarden

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Dun Modr

step Dun Modr
  tip North along the road to Dun Modr. Modr stands in the ruins (use the Goaz Stone); the Captive Fire Elemental is held on the west side: lead it out to Roggo Harlbarrow.
  accept 87491                        -- Captive Fire Elemental

# Groupe Alliance (0.9.9): MacKreel's Moonshine (647) gives 15 minutes to reach Brewmeister
# Bilger in Southshore (Wowhead Forever: Timer 15 minutes); this route reaches Southshore much
# later, so the quest would fail and hold the Southshore step. Optional: the guide no longer sends
# anyone onto the broken bridge, and the hand-in applies only to whoever took it on their own.
step Foggy MacKreel
  zone Arathi Highlands
  accept 647 optional only Dwarf,Gnome,NightElf,Skyborne -- Timed, 15 minutes to Southshore: only with your hearthstone set at Southshore's inn

step Waterlogged Envelope
  collect 4433 x1 optional @44.3,92.9 map 1417 -- Underwater
  accept 637 optional only Dwarf,Gnome,NightElf,Skyborne

step The Villards
  zone Wetlands
  tip Comar Villard waits north of Dun Modr by the Thandol Span; Essene a short walk further north-east.
  accept 87318 optional               -- Comar Villard (Groupe Alliance: optional, Forever players report he no longer offers it)
  turnin 87318 optional               -- Essene Villard

step Dun Modr
  collect 280396 quest 98310.2        -- Heart of Modr
  tip Longbraid the Grim stands in the dwarves' camp.
  turnin 472                              -- Longbraid the Grim
  turnin 87491                        -- Roggo Harlbarrow

step Thandol Span
  zone Wetlands
  tip Follow the road south over the bridge to Dun Modr at the Wetlands end, where Rhag Garmason waits.
  accept 631                          -- Rhag Garmason, Dun Modr

step The Green Belt
  turnin 98245                        -- Howin Kindfeather

# Groupe Alliance (0.9.9): For Further Study (98313) follows Gleaning Our Future (98310).
step Prospector Whelgar
  turnin 98310                        -- Below ground
  accept 98313                            -- For Historian Karnik in Ironforge, at the end of this guide

step Menethil Harbor
  tip West along the road to Menethil.
  turnin 98223                        -- On the top floor

step Menethil Harbor
  tip Captain Stoutfist stands on the top floor of Menethil Keep: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart.
  when group 474
  turnin 474

step Level 31.23
  when !group 474
  when level<31.23
  tip If you skipped Defeat Nek'rosh, grind here to level 31.23 to stay on the route's plan.
  goto 12.3,64.9 map 1437 "Bluegill Raider"
  level 31.23                          -- grind on Bluegill Raider

step Menethil Harbor
  turnin 98072                        -- James Halloran

step Boat to Southshore
  zone Wetlands
  goto 4.78,57.02 "Boat to Southshore"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Southshore

step Southshore
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Pick up everything in town before heading out. Micha Yance and Bartolo Ginsetti stand between the flight master and the inn, Farren and Barkeep Kelly at the inn, Maleb in the town hall.
  # An Alarming Request requires level 30 (Forever's quest data, quest 92432, checked 2026-10-14).
  getfp "Southshore" npc 2432         -- Darla Harris
  buy 3713 x1 npc 2381                -- Soothing Spices, from Micha Yance
  accept 565                          -- Bartolo Ginsetti
  accept 564                          -- Darren Malvew: the lions come later
  accept 555                          -- Chef Jessen, upstairs
  accept 98463                        -- Barkeep Kelly, in the inn: for Booty Bay (04-stranglethorn-vale)
  sethome "Southshore" npc 2352       -- Innkeeper Anderson
  turnin 647 optional only Dwarf,Gnome,NightElf,Skyborne -- Below ground
  turnin 98219 npc 2228               -- Lieutenant Farren Orinelle, inside
  accept 536                          -- Lieutenant Farren Orinelle
  accept 659                          -- Phin Odelic: his trail leads to Arathi
  accept 505                          -- Magistrate Henry Maleb, inside
  accept 92432 "An Alarming Request" npc 247264 lvl 30 -- Emissary Jacques

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The coast

step Torn Fin murlocs
  tip The Torn Fin murlocs crowd the Western Strand, south-west of Southshore.
  tip Careful: One camp holds a tight cluster of Oracles that all aggro together.
  kill 2377 quest 536.1               -- Torn Fin Tidehunter
  kill 2376 quest 536.2               -- Torn Fin Oracle

step Farren
  turnin 536                          -- Inside
  accept 559

step Murloc heads
  tip Back to the same murlocs; not every one drops a head.
  collect 3716 quest 559              -- Murloc Head

step Farren's Proof
  turnin 559                          -- Lieutenant Farren Orinelle, inside
  accept 560
  turnin 560                          -- Marshal Redpath
  accept 561
  turnin 561                          -- Lieutenant Farren Orinelle
  accept 562

step Daggerspine naga
  tip The naga hold the shore south-east of Southshore.
  kill 2369 quest 562.1               -- Daggerspine Shorehunter
  kill 2371 quest 562.2               -- Daggerspine Siren

step Farren
  turnin 562                          -- Inside

step Southshore
  buy 3713 x1 npc 2381                -- Soothing Spices, from Micha Yance

step Farren
  accept 563                          -- A report for Stormwind Keep; inside

step Southshore
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Off the boat, Captain McManus is the first you meet, north-west of the flight master.
  accept 98059                        -- Captain McManus

# Groupe Alliance (0.9.9): Hillsbrad's Hoard (98059) had its hand-in right after the accept and no
# step for its objective (placing the Sealed Company Request in Hillsbrad's town hall, Wowhead
# Forever quest text); the hand-in now waits for the return to Southshore.
step Hillsbrad town hall
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip West of Southshore, in the town hall of Hillsbrad Fields: use the Sealed Company Request from the bags beside the lectern in front of the magistrate's place. Players report it must be the lectern, not the table.
  goto 29.7,41.6 "Hillsbrad Fields town hall"
  use 279386 optional @29.7,41.6

step Yeti cave
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip The yetis live in the cave in the hills north of Southshore, on your way back south.
  collect 3720 quest 565.4            -- Yeti Fur
  note Bartolo also wants a Hillman's Cloak, a Bolt of Woolen Cloth and Fine Thread: crafted or bought; the cloak is turned in when you are back in Southshore later.

step On the way
  along until q505
  zone Alterac Mountains
  kill 2240 quest 505.1
  kill 2241 quest 505.2

step Alterac Mountains
  zone Alterac Mountains
  goto 58.3,68.0 "Alterac Mountains"

step Syndicate camp
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip The Syndicate camp sits on the Alterac border in northern Hillsbrad, west of Tarren Mill (Horde); the documents lie in the camp.
  accept 510 object 1738              -- Syndicate Documents
  accept 511 object 1738

step Alterac Mountains
  zone Alterac Mountains
  goto 29.6,37.5 "Alterac Mountains"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North of Southshore

step Snapjaws
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip The Snapjaw turtles bask along the river east of Southshore, south of Tarren Mill (Horde).
  collect 3712 quest 555              -- Turtle Meat

step Syndicate camp
  label q505
  zone Alterac Mountains
  kill 2240 quest 505.1               -- Syndicate Footpad
  kill 2241 quest 505.2               -- Syndicate Thief

step Hillsbrad Foothills
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  goto 48.9,55.0 "Hillsbrad Foothills"

step Southshore
  buy 3713 x1 npc 2381                -- Soothing Spices, from Micha Yance
  turnin 510                          -- Inside
  accept 512
  turnin 505                          -- Magistrate Henry Maleb
  turnin 511                          -- Loremaster Dibbs
  accept 514
  turnin 555                          -- Chef Jessen, upstairs
  turnin 98059                        -- Captain McManus, north-west of the flight master

step Fly to Ironforge
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  goto 49.4,52.1 "Southshore flight master"
  fly "Ironforge"
  zone Ironforge

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ironforge

step Deeprun Tram
  zone Ironforge
  tip Take the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District to Ironforge.
  turnin 98313                        -- Historian Karnik, Hall of Explorers
  turnin 514                          -- Prospector Stormpike, Hall of Explorers
  accept 707
  accept 525
  accept 1453                         -- Roetten Stonehammer
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock -- Level 30 and 32 spells

step Sara Balloo
  accept 683 only Skyborne

step King Magni Bronzebeard
  when onquest 683
  turnin 683 only Skyborne

step Deeprun Tram
  when onquest 98300
  zone Ironforge
  turnin 98300                        -- King Magni Bronzebeard, the High Seat

step Sara Balloo
  when onquest 637
  turnin 637 only Dwarf,Gnome,NightElf,Skyborne

step Fly to Stormwind
  zone Ironforge
  goto 55.9,47.9 "Ironforge flight master"
  fly "Stormwind"

step The Islander
  zone Stormwind City
  only Warrior
  tip Wu Shen trains warriors in Old Town, beside the Pig and Whistle. Klannoc Macleod waits on Fray Island in the Barrens, on the way to Ratchet much later (40-50/01).
  accept 1718 npc 5479                -- Wu Shen

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Stormwind

step Elling Trias
  zone Ironforge
  tip The cheese shop in the Trade District.
  turnin 1245

step Druid training
  only Druid
  tip Ironforge has no druid trainer: train with Sheldras Moontree in Stormwind before the tram.
  train class

step Elling Trias
  accept 1246

step Dashel Stonefist
  tip Dashel waits in the Pig and Whistle tavern in Old Town; he and his two thugs fight you, but stop once beaten.
  turnin 1246
  accept 1447
  complete 1447
  turnin 1447
  accept 1247

step Stormwind Keep
  turnin 563                          -- Major Samuelson

step Cathedral of Light
  turnin 293                          -- Archbishop Benedictus
  turnin 269                          -- Bishop Farthing
  accept 270

step Mage Quarter
  tip Archmage Malin is in the Slaughtered Lamb; Garion Wendell near the canal; Connor Rivers south of the Mage Quarter.
  accept 79536 optional               -- Garion Wendell: only offered once you have handed in library books (the Library Books guide)
  turnin 79536 optional
  accept 690                          -- Archmage Malin
  accept 1301                         -- Connor Rivers

